How many visits does the South branch show?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(7.5,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/15,2/30,3/45,4/60,5/75} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$}; \draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,3); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,5); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,4); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/North,3/South,5/Central} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.4,2.5) {Visits}; \node[below] at (3,-1.0) {Branch}; \node at (3,6.1) {Branch visits};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

Which team completed the most cases?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.68]
\draw[->] (0,0)--(0,6.4); \draw[->] (0,0)--(9,0); \foreach \y/\lab in {1/8,2/16,3/24,4/32,5/40} {\draw (-0.15,\y)--(0,\y); \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,\y) {$\lab$};} \node[left,font=\scriptsize] at (-0.15,0) {$0$}; \draw (0.4,0) rectangle (1.6,2); \draw (2.4,0) rectangle (3.6,5); \draw (4.4,0) rectangle (5.6,3); \draw (6.4,0) rectangle (7.6,4); \foreach \x/\lab in {1/A,3/B,5/C,7/D} {\node[below,font=\scriptsize] at (\x,0) {\lab};}
\node[rotate=90] at (-1.3,2.5) {Cases}; \node[below] at (4,-1.0) {Team}; \node at (4,6.1) {Cases completed};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
